A practice program to calculate income tax witht he following rules:
Input the gross income, the number of dependents.
Compute the taxable income, using the formula: taxable income equals gross amount - 10000 - (3000 * number of dependents).
Tax equals taxable income * 0.20 (20% of taxable income).
Then print the tax to be paid and a reminder of ways to pay and a potential penalty if tax is not paid.
